          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تفتیش (taftīsh) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic taftīsh, \"a searching, an inspection\". It is the word of police reports and the news."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
