              "text": "is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin ḍhū̃ḍhnā, \"to seek\", under a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 6839). Urdu writes the second ḍ without the breath: ڈھونڈنا (ḍhūnḍnā)."
